#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Java;"
msgstr "&Java;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&Java; allows applications to be downloaded and run by a web browser, "
"provided you have the necessary software installed on your machine. Many web "
"sites make use of &Java; (for example, online banking services or "
"interactive gaming sites). You should be aware that running programs from "
"unknown sources could pose a threat to the security of your computer, even "
"if the potential extent of the damage is not great."
msgstr ""
"&Java; dozvoljava da programi budu preuzimani i pokretani od strane veb "
"pretraživača, omogućava da imate neophodni softver instaliran na vašoj "
"mašini. Mnoge veb stranice koriste &Java;-u (na primjer, online bankarske "
"usluge ili interaktivne stranice za igre). Trebate biti na oprezu jer "
"pokrenuti programi sa nepoznatih izvora mogu predstavljati prijetnju za "
"sigurnost Vašeg kompjutera, čak i ako potencijalna šteta nije velika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The check box <guilabel>Enable Java globally</guilabel> allows you to turn "
"&Java; support on for all web sites by default. You can also select to turn "
"&Java; on or off for specific hosts. To add a policy for a specific host, "
"click the <guibutton>New...</guibutton> button to bring up a dialog in which "
"you can type the host name and then choose to accept or reject &Java; code "
"from that particular host, which will add the domain to the list on the left "
"of the page."
msgstr ""
"Kvadratič pod nazivom <guilabel>Omogući Javu globalno</guilabel> omogućava "
"Vam da se uključite &Java; pomoć zadano za sve stranice. Možete također "
"odabrati da upalite ili ugasite &Javu; na određenih host-ovima. Da dodate "
"pravila za određeni host, kliknite na dugme  <guibutton>Novo...</guibutton> "
"da otvorite okvir u kojem možete ukucati ime host-a i onda odabrati da "
"prihvatite ili odbijete &Java;-u sa određenog hosta, koji će dodati domene "
"na listu u lijevom dijelu stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52 index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select a host in the list, and click the <guibutton>Change...</"
"guibutton> button to choose a different policy for that host. Clicking the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button removes the policy for the selected "
"host; after deletion, the global settings will then apply to that host."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati host iz liste, i kliknuti na dugme  <guibutton>Promijeni...</"
"guibutton> da odaberete drugačija pravila za taj host. Klikom na  "
"<guibutton>Obriši</guibutton> uklanjate pravila za odabrani host; nakon "
"brisanja, globalne postavke će se primjenjivati na taj host."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, the group of controls labeled <guilabel>Java Runtime Settings</"
"guilabel> allows you to set some options for the way in which &Java; should "
"run."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, grupa kontrola pod imenom <guilabel>Postavke Jave za vrijeme "
"izvršavanja</guilabel>  dozvoljavaju Vam da podesite neke opcije za način na "
"koji će &Java; da se pokreće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use security manager</guilabel> is normally enabled by default. "
"This setting will cause the <acronym>JVM</acronym> to run with a Security "
"Manager in place. This will keep applets from being able to read and write "
"to your file system, creating arbitrary sockets, and other actions which "
"could be used to compromise your system. Disable this option at your own "
"risk. You can modify your <filename>$<envar>HOME</envar>/.java.policy</"
"filename> file with the &Java; policytool utility to give code downloaded "
"from certain sites more permissions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristite upravljač sigurnošću</guilabel> je zadano onemogućen. "
"Ova postavka će prouzrokovati da se <acronym>JVM</acronym> pokreće sa "
"Upravitelje sigurnosti. Ovo će onemogućiti malim programima da mogu pisati i "
"čitati iz Vaših sistemskih datoteka, kreirajući proizvoljne veze, i ostale "
"radnje koje bi mogle  biti korištene da se našteti Vašem sistemu. "
"Onemogućite ovu opcije na vlastiti rizik. Možete podesiti vaš <filename>"
"$<envar>HOME</envar>/.java.policy</filename> dokumenat sa &Java; alatom za "
"korištenje pravila da Vam da kod preuzet sa neke stranice sa više dozvola."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use KIO</guilabel> will cause the <acronym>JVM</acronym>to use "
"&kde;'s own <acronym>KIO</acronym> transports for network connections."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristi KIO</guilabel> će prouzrokovati <acronym>JVM</acronym> da "
"koristi &kde;'ov sopstveni <acronym>KIO</acronym> transport za internet "
"konekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Shutdown applet server when inactive for more than</guilabel> "
"check box allows you to save resources by closing the &Java; Applet Server "
"when it is not in use, rather than leaving it running in the background. "
"Leaving this disabled may make &Java; applets start up faster, but it will "
"use system resources when you are not using a &Java; applet. If you enable "
"this, you can set a timeout."
msgstr ""
"Kvadratić <guilabel>Ugasi male programe ako su neaktivni više od</guilabel> "
"omogućava Vam da sačuvate resurse kada ne koristite &Java; male programe. "
"Ako omogućite ovo, možete postaviti vrijeme za gašenje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can either opt to have &konqueror; automatically detect the &Java; "
"installation on your system, or specify the path to the installation "
"yourself by selecting <guilabel>Path to Java executable or 'java'</"
"guilabel>. You may want to choose the latter method, for instance, if you "
"have multiple &Java; installations on your system, and want to specify which "
"one to use. If the &Java; Virtual Machine you are using requires any special "
"startup options, you can type them in the text box labeled "
"<guilabel>Additional Java arguments</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete se odlučiti da li će &konqueror; automatski detektovati &Java; "
"instalaciju na vašem sistemu, ili specificirati put za samostalnu "
"instalaciju birajući <guilabel>Put do Java izvršavanja ili 'java'</"
"guilabel>. Možda ćete htjeti odabrati kasniju metodu, na primjer, ako imate "
"višestruke &Java; instalacije na vašem sistemu, i želite da odredite koja će "
"se koristiti. Ako &Java; Virtualna mašina koju koristite zahtijeva bilo "
"kakve specijelne opcije, možete ih ukucati u prostor za tekst pod naslovom "
"<guilabel>Dodatni Java argumenti</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>JavaScript</title>"
msgstr "<title>JavaScript</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Despite the name, JavaScript is not related at all to &Java;."
msgstr "Uprkos imenu, JavaScript nije povezana sa &Java;-om."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first part of this tab works the same as the &Java; settings."
msgstr "Prvi dio ovog taba radi isto kao i &Java; postavke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The checkbox <guilabel>Enable JavaScript globally</guilabel> allows you to "
"turn JavaScript support on for all web sites by default. You can also select "
"to turn JavaScript on or off for specific hosts. To add a policy for a "
"specific host, click the <guibutton>New...</guibutton> button to bring up a "
"dialog in which you can type the host name and then choose to accept or "
"reject JavaScript code from that particular host, which will add the domain "
"to the list on the left of the page."
msgstr ""
"Kvadratić <guilabel>Omogućite JavaScript globalno</guilabel> omogućava Vam "
"da uključite JavaScript pomoć zadano za sve veb stranice. Možete također "
"odabrati da upalite ili ugasite JavaScript za određene host-ove. Da dodate "
"pravila za određeni host, kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Novo...</guibutton> "
"da otvorite okvir u kom možete ukucati ime host-a i onda odabrati da "
"prihvatite i odbijete JavaScript za određene host-ove, koje će dodati domenu "
"na listu na lijevoj strani ove stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final set of options in the section <guilabel>Global JavaScript "
"Policies</guilabel> determine what happens when a page uses JavaScript for "
"specific actions."
msgstr ""
"Konačni komplet opcija u sekciji <guilabel>Globalna pravila JavaScript-a</"
"guilabel> određuju šta će se desiti kada stranica koristi JavaScript za "
"određene akcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can individually enable or disable the ability of JavaScript to "
"manipulate your windows by moving, resizing or changing focus. You can also "
"disable JavaScript from changing the status bar text, so that for instance, "
"you can always see where links will take you when clicked. The choices for "
"these options are <guilabel>Allow</guilabel> and <guilabel>Ignore</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Možete pojedinačno omogućiti ili onemogućiti sposobnost JavaScript-a da "
"manipuliše Vašim prozorom pomijerajući ga, mijenjajući mu veličinu ili "
"fokus. Možete također onemogućiti JavaScript da mijenja tekst u statusnoj "
"traci, tako da na primjer, možete uvijek vidjeti gdje Vas link vodi kada ga "
"kliknete. Izbori za ove opcije su <guilabel>Dozvoli</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Ignoriši</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For opening a new window, there is even more control. You can set "
"&konqueror; to <guilabel>Allow</guilabel> all such requests, <guilabel>Ask</"
"guilabel> each time a request is made, or <guilabel>Deny</guilabel> all "
"popup requests."
msgstr ""
"Za otvaranje novog prozora, postoji čak i više kontrola. Možete podesiti "
"&konqueror; da <guilabel>Dozvoli</guilabel> sve takve zahtjeve, "
"<guilabel>Pita</guilabel> svaki put kada je zahtjev napravljen, ili "
"<guilabel>Odbije</guilabel> sve pop-up zahtjeve."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Smart</guilabel> setting will only allow JavaScript popup "
"windows when you have explicitly chosen a link that creates one."
msgstr ""
"Postavka <guilabel>Pametno</guilabel>  će dozvoliti JavaScript pop-up "
"prozorime jedino kada imate eksplicitno odabran link koji ih kreira."
